# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
#
# Why this exists: this machine has core.autocrlf=true, so a checkout rewrote every file to CRLF,
# while oxfmt writes and expects LF. The result was `npm run format:check` failing on all 36 files
# immediately after a branch switch, with `git status` clean and `git diff` empty — the changes
# were invisible because they were pure line endings. `eol=lf` pins the working tree too, so
# autocrlf can no longer flip files back and the quality gate stays stable across checkouts/clones.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.sqlite binary
